    "termsTitle": "Terms of Service",
    "termsSubtitle": "Last Updated: March 2026",
    "termsSec1Title": "1. Uncensored Freedom of Speech",
    "termsSec1Text": "At Pulso we believe in true, uncensored freedom of expression. You are free to post your ideas, thoughts, and opinions openly. We are inspired to create a free town square where debate flows without unjustified restrictions. What you post is solely your responsibility.",
    "termsSec1Muted": "Pulso will only intervene on content that violates explicit court orders or constitutes severe criminal offenses, always prioritizing your right to debate and speak freely.",
    "termsSec2Title": "2. Content Ownership",
    "termsSec2Text": "What you post is yours. You retain all intellectual property rights over the content you submit or post on Pulso. By posting it, you grant us a worldwide license to distribute such content within the platform.",
    "termsSec3Title": "3. Restrictions (Anti-Spam and Abuse)",
    "termsSec3Text": "You may not use Pulso to send spam, saturate servers with automated scripts, or create mass accounts. We have rate, size, and frequency limits to protect the infrastructure and other users.",
    "termsSec4Title": "4. Account Suspension",
    "termsSec4Text": "We reserve the right to suspend or delete accounts that repeatedly violate these terms, or participate in impersonation or data theft activities.",
    "backToHome": "Back to Home",
    "privacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
    "privacySubtitle": "Last Updated: March 2026",
    "privacySec1Title": "1. Habeas Data Right",
    "privacySec1Text": "In accordance with Article 15 of the Political Constitution of Colombia, all persons have the right to know, update, and rectify information collected in databases. At Pulso, we respect this right rigorously.",
    "privacySec2Title": "2. Protection of Sensitive Data (Not Leaked)",
    "privacySec2Text": "Your safety is a priority. We have implemented security restrictions on the server to guarantee that passwords and emails are never leaked in public responses or tweet feeds.",
    "privacySec3Title": "3. End-to-End Encryption in Messages",
    "privacySec3Text": "Your private conversations are protected with End-to-End Encryption (E2EE). Not even Pulso servers can read them; only you and the recipient hold the exclusive cryptographic keys to decrypt the content.",
    "privacySec4Title": "4. Storage and Deletion",
    "privacySec4Text": "Your posts are transmitted securely in real-time. If you decide to delete a Tweet or your conversation, the corresponding records are deleted from our servers actively cleaning the history.",
